**Priority:** 1 = resolve soon, 5 = low urgency.

---

## Debt Categories

Use these categories when adding new entries:

| Category | Description |
|----------|------------|
| `schema` | Data model or naming issues |
| `architecture` | Design patterns that need rework |
| `security` | Security gaps or hardened areas needed |
| `test-coverage` | Missing or insufficient automated tests |
| `documentation` | Missing or outdated docs |
| `dependency` | Outdated or risky third-party dependencies |
| `performance` | Known performance bottlenecks |
| `tooling` | Build, pipeline, or dev tooling issues |

