## Debt Addition Guidelines

When adding new debt:
1. Assign the next sequential ID (e.g., TD-002).
2. Describe the problem — not the solution.
3. Estimate impact and effort.
4. Link to a tracking ticket if one exists.
5. Update `last-updated` in the frontmatter.
